  "description": "Hand built with love, care, and bloodlust in the US of A.\nAll the same specs you know and love from the OG UD, just fancier:\n\nThe beautiful sledgehammer. Seek, destroy, love, embrace. Do whatever. This bike can handle it.\nFully-sleeved internal cable routing. Compatible with 120mm-150mm travel forks, this frame has room for 29x2.6 (bigger with the dropout slid back) and also works great with mullet wheels. All of our frames feature sliding dropouts for worshipping the one true gear (or optimizing your geometry based on your fork travel while keeping your gears).\nRoll your own and make it any bike you want it to be!\nBoost 148 spacing, 73mm threaded BB, ZS44 upper/ZS56 lower headset compatibility, 31.6 seat post diameter.\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\nStock Color for these bad boys is the Pink/Purple Oceanic Sparkle Fade. It's like the OG, but with more shimmer and a dash of sexy. If you want something different, let's talk:\nCustom powder will cost additional $150 and available for a limited time. Single color Cerakote (like the sparkle clear coat shown below) will cost additional $200. IF YOU SELECT EITHER CUSTOM OPTION, EMAIL US IMMEDIATELY to get the paint process started. We want you to be riding this bike ASAP. Custom work takes time, as we all know.\nIF you are wanting a more custom paint than one or two colors of powder or cerakote, we have fully custom partners we can direct you to. Also, you fancy.",
